    "synopsis": {
        "native": "En plein milieu de la nuit, L\u00e9o r\u00e9veille son meilleur pote, Rapha\u00ebl. Sa voiture est en panne, \u00e0 une heure de Paris. Hors de question pour Rapha\u00ebl d\u2019y aller\u2026 jusqu\u2019\u00e0 ce que la femme de sa vie le pousse hors du lit. Arriv\u00e9 sur place, il d\u00e9couvre qu\u2019il n\u2019y a aucune panne mais du champagne, des amis et une f\u00eate improvis\u00e9e\u2026 L\u00e9o a fait un test \u00e0 l\u2019amiti\u00e9. Et si une amiti\u00e9, une existence enti\u00e8re ne d\u00e9pendait que de cette seule question : \u00ab Tu te serais lev\u00e9, toi, pour aller d\u00e9panner un pote \u00e0 3h du matin ? \u00bb",
        "english": "In the middle of the night, L\u00e9o wakes up his best friend Rapha\u00ebl. His car has broken down an hour away from Paris. No way is Rapha\u00ebl going to pick him up...that is until the woman of his dreams kicks him out of bed. Once he gets to where L\u00e9o is waiting, he discovers there is no breakdown, although there is champagne, friends, and an improvised party... L\u00e9o has carried out a test of friendship. And what if a friendship, a whole lifetime depended on this single question: Would you have got up at 3 o'clock in the morning to go and help a friend?"
    },
